OL,3,GNEWSAMan crushed under coach thanks
OL,4,Alife-saving medics
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 53-year-old said: "If I lived 1,000
OL,7,Fmore years there still would not be
OL,8,Fenough time for me to express the
OL,9,Fgratitude I have to everyone that
OL,10,Fhelped rescue me that day."
